==Trivia==
This card is one of several in the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion to feature a cameo from {{p|Mew}} in its illustration.

===Origin===
*{{m|Mimic}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Chatot}} can learn.
